  "updated_at": "2026-03-08",
  "bio": "Carlos Castillo is a renowned tattoo artist based in Valencia, Venezuela, known for his exceptional skill in black & gray, trash polka, and watercolor tattooing styles. His work is characterized by its intricate detail and masterful use of color, making him a sought-after artist for those seeking unique and eye-catching designs. Committed to his craft, Carlos maintains a high level of professionalism that, coupled with his artistic talent, ensures every client leaves with a piece of art they cherish.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Valencia, Carabobo, Venezuela"
